  "text": {
    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "user-cc3049cb53@example.invalid",
    "text": "<p>REDMOND, Wash.--(<a href=\"http://www.businesswire.com/\" target=\"_blank\">BUSINESS WIRE</a>)--(Product Bulletin) <a href=\"http://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.physio-control.com&amp;esheet=51540145&amp;newsitemid=20170419005206&amp;lan=en-US&amp;anchor=Physio-Control&amp;index=1&amp;md5=38cdbd85b64e44fd67da85de58db0991\" target=\"_blank\">Physio-Control</a> announced today that the company’s <a href=\"http://cts.businesswire.com/ct/CT?id=smartlink&amp;url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.physio-control.com%2FWCProductDetails.aspx%3Fid%3D2147498676&amp;esheet=51540145&amp;newsitemid=20170419005206&amp;lan=en-US&amp;anchor=HeartSine%C2%AE+samaritan%C2%AE+PAD+360P&amp;index=2&amp;md5=64b7d7670c2bc2c82399474881c1f2c8\" target=\"_blank\">HeartSine® samaritan® PAD 360P</a> (SAM 360P) fully automatic external defibrillator (AED) is now available for sale in the United States, having received U.S. Food and Drug Administration (FDA) Premarket Approval (PMA).</p>\n<p>HeartSine, acquired by Physio-Control in 2015, is the first to receive approval for a new AED product under the FDA PMA regulatory process, which is the most stringent for medical devices in the United States and is a new FDA regulatory requirement for the AED industry.<br>\n</p>\n<p><b>Read the full article:</b></p>\n<p><a href=\"http://www.businesswire.com/news/home/20170419005206/en/Physio-Control-Launches-HeartSine%C2%AE-samaritan%C2%AE-PAD-360P-Automated\" target=\"_blank\">Business Wire</a></p>\n",
    "jcr:lastModified": "Tue May 30 2017 17:47:40 GMT-0400",
